,{"variant":"THUMBNAIL","url":"https://images-ng.pixai.art/images/thumb/98cd261b-9a65-42cd-916b-df27b5e61607","__typename":"ImageUrl"},{"variant":"STILL_THUMBNAIL","url":"https://images-ng.pixai.art/images/stillThumb/98cd261b-9a65-42cd-916b-df27b5e61607","__typename":"ImageUrl"}],"imageType":"png","fileUrl":null,"duration":null,"thumbnailUrl":null,"hlsUrl":null,"size":null,"flag":{"shouldBlur":false,"__typename":"ModerationFlag"},"__typename":"Media"},"type":"DIT7B_MODEL","category":null,"extra":{"claimed":false,"isMinors":false,"isWarned":false,"isSexyPic":false,"cpKeywords":[],"isSexyText":false,"description":"# ✨ **Tsubaki**  \nA next-generation PixAI model built **entirely from scratch**, powered by cutting-edge **Diffusion Transformers (DiT)**.\nDiT combines the creative breadth of diffusion models with the efficiency of transformer attention—delivering sharper details, richer compositions, and smarter prompt handling.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Key Strengths\n\n- **Natural-language prompts** supported (tags optional)  \n- **Fine-grained prompt following**, even with per-character instructions in a single image  \n- **Long, detailed, and complex prompts** fully supported  \n- **Higher-quality multi-character generation** (spacing, interaction, balance)  \n- **Improved character interactions** (eye-lines, gestures, overlaps)\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Smarter Prompt Helper (ON by default)\n\nOur **improved Prompt Helper** auto-rewrites your input on the fly—injecting style tags, balancing weights, and optimizing structure for DiT.  \n- **Short prompts?** No problem—Prompt Helper fills in the gaps.  \n- Prefer full control? Toggle it **OFF** and supply a long, descriptive prompt for best results.\n\n> *Tip:* To inspect the rewritten prompt, open **Profile → Generation Tasks → your task**.\n\n---\n\n# ✨ **Tsubaki**  \nPixAI がゼロから開発した次世代モデル。最先端の **Diffusion Transformers（DiT）** を採用しています。  \nDiT は拡散モデルの表現力とトランスフォーマーアテンションの効率性を融合し、より鮮明なディテール、豊かな構図、そして賢いプロンプト解釈を実現します。\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 主な強み\n\n- **自然言語プロンプト** に対応 (タグでもOK!）  \n- 1枚の画像内でキャラクターごとの指示も忠実に反映  \n- 長文・詳細・複雑なプロンプトにも対応  \n- 複数キャラクター生成の品質向上（配置・相互作用・バランス）  \n- キャラクター間のインタラクション表現がさらに自然（視線・ジェスチャー・重なり）\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 改良版 Prompt Helper（デフォルト ON）\n\n改良版 **Prompt Helper** が入力をリアルタイムで自動リライトし、スタイルタグの挿入や重み付けを調整して DiT に最適化します。  \n- **短いプロンプトでも問題なし** — Prompt Helper が不足を補います。  \n- 完全に手動で制御したい場合はPrompt Helperを **OFF** にしてください。その場合、高品質な画像を得るためには長くて詳細なプロンプトをオススメします。\n\n> *ヒント:* 拡張されたプロンプトを確認するには **Profile → Generation Tasks → 該当するタスク** を開いてください。\n\n---","isRealistic":false,"isSensitive":false,"modelAuthor":null,"permissions":{"personalUses":true,"commercialUses":true,"shareImagesOnline":true,"shouldCreditAuthor":true},"triggerWords":"","weightOffset":47,"isEarlyAccess":false,"accessRoleList":[],"moderationHuman":"1755849683196","moderationMachine":"Fri Jun 13 2025 06:10:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","sensitiveKeywords":[],"censorRetriedCount":3,"moderationTagAnime":false,"censorSensitiveFlag":"PASS","moderationTagJunior":false,"moderationTagRealistic":false},"createdAt":"2025-05-27T14:20:20.512Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-06T07:55:43.558Z","isNsfw":false,"isDownloadable":false,"flag":{"shouldBlur":false,"__typename":"ModerationFlag"},"loraBaseModelTypes":[],"isPrivate":false,"accessType":null,"visibilityType":"PUBLIC","userPermission":"3","__typename":"GenerationModel","likedCount":6929,"liked":false,"refCount":21204716,"commentCount":276,"artworkSafetyScore":null,"latestAvailableVersion":{"id":"1894092844569363483","modelId":"1884107375027888751","mediaId":"599854486757249559","media":{"id":"599854486757249559","type":"IMAGE","width":1024,"height":1024,"urls":[{"variant":"PUBLIC","url":"https://images-ng.pixai.art/images/orig/1c58d1e1-2cd4-48d2-b694-a7ab8e50277a","__typename":"ImageUrl"},{"variant":"THUMBNAIL","url":"https://images-ng.pixai.art/images/thumb/1c58d1e1-2cd4-48d2-b694-a7ab8e50277a","__typename":"ImageUrl"},{"variant":"STILL_THUMBNAIL","url":"https://images-ng.pixai.art/images/stillThumb/1c58d1e